flowchart TD
  A[Employee asks in Teams<br/>English, Hindi or Hinglish] --> B[Load Workday profile<br/>country, grade, type, service]
  B --> C{Safety triage<br/>rules, before any AI}
  C -->|Crisis| C1[Emergency numbers + ER ticket<br/>sent immediately]
  C -->|Harassment, grievance| C2[Confidential ER ticket draft<br/>or anonymous Speak Up]
  C -->|Medical, bereavement, legal,<br/>layoff, performance, resignation| C3[HR partner ticket draft<br/>employee approves send]
  C -->|Pay problem| C4[Payroll ticket draft]
  C -->|IT, other people's data| C5[Redirect or refuse]
  C -->|Policy question| D{Asks about another<br/>country's policy?}
  D -->|Yes| D1[Say it only covers own country<br/>offer HR partner]
  D -->|No| E[Eligibility filter<br/>own country + global, audience,<br/>live today, superseded removed]
  E --> F[Retrieve top sections<br/>BM25 + synonyms, later hybrid]
  F --> G{Relevant section found?}
  G -->|No| G1[Not in policy library<br/>offer HR partner, never guess]
  G -->|Yes| H[Grok drafts JSON answer with citations<br/>Claude Haiku fallback]
  H --> I{Verification<br/>cited, numbers grounded,<br/>no promise, no legal advice}
  I -->|Fail| I1[Extractive answer:<br/>quote the policy section]
  I -->|Pass| J[Answer + section links<br/>+ non-commitment wording]
  I1 --> J
  J --> K[Redacted log + feedback<br/>thumbs down to policy owner]
  C1 --> K
  C2 --> K
  C3 --> K
  C4 --> K
